@format 1
@id project.import-scene
@title Import scene
@area Project
@entry input
@summary Read a standalone scene JSON file, assign a collision-free name, and add it to the persisted scene collection.
@flow TB
@related project.export-scene, project.load-scene

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias scene = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScene

[input] Import requested <input>
- Show the scene open-file dialog @ console.PConsoleImportHandle(...)
> read

[read] Parse scene file <decision>
- Read and validate the selected JSON scene @ scene.LSceneFileLoad(...)
? "File is invalid or unreadable" > failed
? "A scene record is read" > name

[name] Resolve imported name <process>
- Derive a missing name and make it unique in the scene collection @ console.PConsoleNameCreate(...)
> persist

[persist] Save imported scene <storage>
- Add the scene to persistent named scenes and rebuild the list @ scene.LSceneSave(...)
> result

[result] Scene imported <output>
= The imported scene is available under its resolved unique name.

[failed] Import failed <error>
= No named scene is added.
